// The truth of the fair set (S59) for Lassen, Vorsatz Op.48-4: written from the Bosworth print
// (IMSLP #679347, data/fair/lassen48-4/bosworth), bar by bar. Never to debug the reader on.
// As the print has them: the arpeggios of bars 4 and 31 are one wavy line through both staves (both chords
// are marked); the releases of bars 19 and 27 stand under the held chord (a spacer carries them); "meno f"
// is the word and the dynamic's sign.
title "Resolution"
subtitle "(Vorsatz.)"
composer "Ed. Lassen, Op. 48. No 4."
poet "Robert Prutz."
tempo "Andantino"
octave absolute
paper { breaksOnly }
time 3/4
key ees major

part voice_ { clef treble }
part rh { clef treble }
part lh { clef bass pedal text }

